message: "If you cite this software, forensic repository, or actuarial methodology in academic literature, legal arbitration proceedings, or corporate risk assessments, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ALPAR AI: Sovereign Trust, Forensic Incident Registry, and Actuarial Risk Infrastructure for Autonomous AI Systems"
abstract: "ALPAR AI is an open-core sovereign trust infrastructure, forensic incident registry, and actuarial rating framework designed to establish accountability, legal culpability, and operational resilience for autonomous artificial intelligence models. Integrating an in-memory Epistemic Firewall with ISO/IEC 27037 forensic chain-of-custody protocols and EU AI Act Article 73 telemetry, ALPAR AI provides actuarial risk benchmarking and neutral third-party dispute arbitration across international jurisdictions."
